      fullContent: MultilingualText(
        en: 'Small Industries Development Bank of India (SIDBI) in partnership with commercial banks launched the expanded Emergency Credit Guarantee Scheme (ECLGS 2.0).\n\nKey Highlights:\n1. 100% Government Guarantee: Commercial banks will issue 100% collateral-free credit to registered MSMEs, artisans, and shopkeepers.\n2. Subsidized Interest Rate: Interest capped at 7.5% per annum with a 12-month moratorium period on principal repayment.\n3. Automatic Credit Top-up: Existing loan holders get up to 20% additional working capital line automatically credited.\n4. Instant Verification via Udyam Aadhaar: Direct digital onboarding integrated inside Schemora.',
